  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIWI, 110701 - 160630 Anti-corruption capacity building Water Integrity</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SIWI, 110701 - 160630 korruptionsbek&#xe4;mpning kapacitetsupp Water Integrity Prog</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det regionala kapacitetsuppbyggnad program f&#xf6;r vatten Integrity i     Afrika s&#xf6;der om Sahara kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra utbildningar anpassade    till kapacitetsbehov, s&#xe4;rskilda m&#xe5;l och m&#xe5;lgrupper. Det kommer att    genomf&#xf6;ras i tre delregioner i samarbete med regionala                organisationer: SIWI ansvarar f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet i &#xd6;stafrika           tillsammans med Victoriasj&#xf6;n bass&#xe4;ngen, Cap-Net i s&#xf6;dra Afrika tillsa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Capacity Building Programme on Water Integrity in        Sub-Saharan Africa will carry out trainings adapted to capacity       needs, specific objectives and target groups. It will be implemented  in three sub-regions in collaboration with regional organisations:    SIWI responsible for implementation in East Africa together with Lake Victoria Basin; Cap-Net in Southern Africa together with Southern Afr</narrative>
  </description>
